* news_process v3.2.0 — Master 总编排脚本 (plan v14 §9.2)
* 由 build_replication_package 从模板生成 (plan v14 §9.3)
* Plan 版本: v14, 冻结于 git tag plan-stage3-dual-track-frozen
*
* 主规格选择 Main spec choices (由论文 Methods §4 决定, 模板替换占位符):
*   LOCUS_TRACK:  {{MAIN_LOCUS_TRACK}}    (lf=全文分类 full-text / lc=实体上下文 entity-context)
*   SUBST_TRACK:  {{MAIN_SUBST_TRACK}}    (sf=全文 full-text / sc=实体上下文 entity-context)
*   SENT_TRACK:   {{MAIN_SENT_TRACK}}     (full / ctx)
*
* Stata 版本要求: ≥ 19 (项目策略 2026-05-16: Stata 19+ only, 无需向下兼容)
* 必需包: ssc install reghdfe ivreg2 ranktest estout coefplot asdoc
*   稳健性/IV/DiD 附加包 (审计 2026-06-14 补): csdid drdid (15_M7 错时 DiD), weakiv
*   (19_ 弱工具稳健 AR CI), boottest rwolf wyoung (推断/FWER)。缺则相应稳健性表 capture
*   守卫优雅跳过 (复现包会静默缺该对象), 复现前请 ssc install。

version 19
clear all
set maxvar 32767
set linesize 120

* Project root (用户运行前修改为本地路径)
local project_root "{{PROJECT_ROOT}}"
cd "`project_root'"

* 0. 数据准备
do "code/01_data_prep.do"

